<title>USA: Value City declines comment on trading.</title>
<headline>Value City declines comment on trading.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Value City Department Stores Inc on Monday declined to comment about trading activity in its stock, in response to a request by the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said its policy not to comment on the trading in its shares, which closed down one at eight on Monday.</p>
<p>Value City is an off-price department store chain with 93 outlets in the U.S. East and Midwest. Last week, it reported same-store sales in January fell one percent.</p>
</text>
